                <head>269. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>At a luncheon on March 21, President Eisenhower’s guests were Prime Minister
                    Macmillan, Foreign Secretary Lloyd, Secretary of State Dulles, the President’s
                    Staff Secretary General Goodpaster, and Patrick Dean, Deputy Under Secretary at
                    the Foreign Office. (Eisenhower Library, President’s Appointment Book)</p>
            </div>
